{
  "esm": "2.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "LiftOperatorElementwise",
    "description": "Pointwise lift through an operator_compose whose operator is written elementwise, D(_var) = -km * _var with km on [lev], not as a makearray. lifting is omitted, so it is pointwise (esm-spec 10.5). Both species of Mech are lifted onto [lev], with fresh loop symbols _p0.",
